.sp .5
The following words are recognized and are set in font 1.
.ta .5i 2i 3.5i 4.5i 
	Im	Re	and	arc
	cos	cosh	coth	det
	exp	for	if	lim
	ln	log	max	min
	sin	sinh	tan	tanh
